1126	{"artifactId":"EXT-c2ba6fa62a148ed1-s12","entry":{"id":"85eecc34","text":"Boundary decision 2026-10-17 (s13 option A): s12's parser work also covers emitting a binding key with every call and type reference, in every supported parser, derived from the caller's own file without reading another file: (target file id, exported name) for TypeScript/JavaScript and Python (relative or path-mapped specifiers resolved to the target's absolute path; namespace imports and module-qualified calls likewise), and (package, name) for Go, Java, Kotlin and Scala (explicit or wildcard import, or the caller's own package for an unqualified call); plus classifying a call as external (bound to a module outside the repository) or unbindable (unknown receiver type, Scala implicits, computed dynamic imports) at parse time. s13 consumes these keys in its pending map. Build order: s1 -> s3 -> s2 -> s12 -> s13.","actor":{"id":"legacy:subho-ghosh-stakeholder-chat-2026-10-17","kind":"person","properties":{"name":"Subho Ghosh (stakeholder, chat 2026-10-17)"}},"timestamp":"2026-10-17T16:23:58.496Z","feedback":[],"kind":"revision-request"}}
